00:47:22,105 --> 00:47:28,105
Dream Girl 2 is a 2023 Indian Hindi-language comedy-drama film directed by Raaj Shaandilyaa
and produced by Ekta Kapoor and Shobha Kapoor under Balaji Motion Pictures.

11
00:52:06,315 --> 00:52:12,315
A spiritual sequel to the 2019 film Dream Girl, the film stars Ayushmann Khurrana, alongside an ensemble supporting cast, including
Ananya Panday, Paresh Rawal, Annu Kapoor, Rajpal Yadav, Vijay Raaz, Asrani, Abhishek Banerjee, Manjot Singh and Seema Pahwa.

12
00:56:50,526 --> 00:56:56,526
The film is about a man who cross-dresses and disguises as
a woman, leading to chaos and confusion.

13
01:01:34,736 --> 01:01:40,736
Principal photography began in August 2022 and ended in March 2023.

14
01:06:18,947 --> 01:06:24,947
It was released theatrically on 25 August 2023.

15
01:11:03,157 --> 01:11:09,157
The film received mixed reviews from critics.

16
01:15:47,368 --> 01:15:53,368
It was a commercial success, grossing ₹140 crore worldwide, emerging
as the eleventh-highest grossing Hindi film of 2023.

17
01:20:31,578 --> 01:20:37,578
It marked the final film appearance of Asrani
before his death on 20 October 2025.

